"async" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" class="mw-file-element" srcset="/images/Misthalin_League_Region_Badge.png?f2c0a 2x" data-file-width="50" data-file-height="50" /></a></span><span class="league-name"><a href="/w/Equilibrium_League/Regions/Misthalin" title="Equilibrium League/Regions/Misthalin">Misthalin</a></span><span class="league-check">✓</span></span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="6">Teleports</th><td colspan="14" data-attr-param="teleport">
